@startuml state-voice-input
!include style.iuml
title The chat's message box with voice input (state machine, ADR-012)
hide empty description

state "Empty\n(microphone shown)" as Empty
state "Typing\n(send shown)" as Typing
state "Listening\n(words appear, sound level,\n✓ and ✕ shown)" as Listening
state "Sending" as Sending
state "Voice unavailable\n(microphone hidden)" as NoVoice

[*] --> Empty
Empty --> Typing : person types
Typing --> Empty : text cleared
Empty --> Listening : tap microphone;\nspeech service ready
Empty --> Empty : no microphone permission:\nnote says how to allow it
Empty --> NoVoice : phone has no\nspeech service
NoVoice --> Typing : person types
Listening --> Typing : ✓, 3 s of silence or 60 s:\nthe words stay in the box
Listening --> Empty : ✕ (words thrown away)
Typing --> Sending : tap send
Sending --> Empty : answer shown\n(or the error in words)
@enduml
